lindalf (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Initial release.
  * ASCII wizard animation with ANSI 256-colour rendering at 24 FPS.
  * Smoke particle system rising from wizard's pipe.
  * ALSA WAV playback with real-time DSP: volume, LFO, reverb.
  * Threaded architecture: animation, audio, input all separate.
  * Keyboard-driven live parameter control.

